        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our long-term growth strategy, we invest in technologies and partner with leading software platform vendors to develop applications that (i) serve our guests with omni-channel buying options offering enhanced speed and transparency, and (ii) drive a more efficient guest experience at a lower cost to serve.",
